{"nodes": [{"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "label": "Home / Cat\u00e1logo Mobile Screen", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "body carries pb-[120px] and min-height max(884px, 100dvh) to clear the bottom nav plus the fixed action zone on a 884px-tall reference device."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_top_bar", "label": "Mobile Top App Bar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "header h-[56px] md:hidden", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "56px bar reduced to menu / centered wordmark (headline-lg-mobile) / cart; the four primary destinations move out of the header into the bottom navigation."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_search_section", "label": "Mobile Search and Vehicle Selector", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "'Buscar por n\u00famero OEM o palabra clave...' + 'A\u00f1adir Veh\u00edculo' + 'Filtrar'", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The desktop VIN field becomes a persistent 'A\u00f1adir Veh\u00edculo' action paired with a filled 'Filtrar' button; the hero image is dropped entirely so the search tools occupy the first viewport on small screens."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_filter_bottom_sheet", "label": "Filter Bottom Sheet Drawer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "div#filterDrawer / #filterDrawerContent, h-[751px] rounded-t-xl", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The desktop sidebar's persistent accordion is restated as a modal sheet over a blurred scrim, with facets flattened into always-open sections (Categor\u00eda as a 2-up checkbox grid, Marca as a list, Disponibilidad as a toggle switch) and a pinned 1/3 'Limpiar' + 2/3 'Aplicar Filtros (24)' bar. The result count moves onto the apply button because there is no results header visible behind the sheet."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_filter_drawer_script", "label": "Bottom Sheet Open/Close Script", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "inline script openDrawer/closeDrawer, translate-y-full + opacity, 300ms, scrim click-to-close", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Forces a reflow (void drawer.offsetWidth) before removing the transform so the slide-up transition actually plays from the hidden state; dismissal is available from the close button, the apply button and the scrim."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_horizontal_filter_chip_rail", "label": "Horizontal Snap-Scroll Filter Chips", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "overflow-x-auto hide-scrollbar snap-x chip rail", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mixes applied chips (primary-container, dismissible) with suggested '+ Motor' / '+ Suspensi\u00f3n' add-chips in one rail, so the same strip both reports and extends the query. Scrollbar is hidden via .hide-scrollbar for a native feel."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_compact_product_card", "label": "Compact Mobile Product Card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "article.bg-surface-container-lowest, pt-[100%] square media", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Square aspect media via pt-[100%] padding trick, corner compatibility pill, 2-line title at label-sm, 10px OEM line, primary-colored price and a full-width action button. The compatibility strip and condition badge from desktop are compressed into one glyph to fit a half-width card."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_two_column_product_grid", "label": "Two-Column Mobile Product Grid", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "section.grid.grid-cols-2.gap-sm", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_compatibility_status_badge", "label": "Compatibility Status Badge (Green/Amber/Red)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "check_circle #10b981, warning #f59e0b, cancel #ba1a1a on card media corner", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A three-state traffic-light applied to the selected vehicle: fits, verify specs, or does not fit. The red state also disables the CTA ('No Compatible', cursor-not-allowed, neutral surface) instead of hiding the product - keeping incompatible results visible so the user learns why they were excluded."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_bottom_navigation_bar", "label": "Mobile Bottom Navigation Bar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "nav fixed bottom-0 h-[60px] pb-safe, Inicio / Cat\u00e1logo / Mi Garaje / Cuenta", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four destinations; the active item is marked with a filled glyph, primary text, a top border and a primary-container/20 wash. 'Mi Garaje' is a mobile-only destination with no desktop nav equivalent, implying saved-vehicle state as a first-class mobile concept."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_whatsapp_fab", "label": "WhatsApp FAB with Inline Brand SVG", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "a.fixed.bottom-[80px].right-md, 48px circle, inline SVG path", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Source comment states the reason for the inline SVG: 'Material doesn't have a specific brand icon'. Parked at bottom-80px and z-40 so it floats clear of the 60px bottom nav rather than overlapping it."}, {"id": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_compact_footer", "label": "Compact Mobile Footer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "footer, centered single column, Contacto + T\u00e9rminos + copyright", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The four desktop footer columns collapse to a wordmark, two links and a copyright line, since navigation duty has moved to the bottom nav."}], "edges": [{"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_desktop_design_token_system", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "identical tailwind.config token block", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_desktop_material_symbols_icon_family", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": ".material-symbols-outlined.fill modifier", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_top_bar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "<!-- Top Navigation (Mobile Adapted) -->", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_search_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "<!-- Search & Filter Hero Section -->", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_bottom_navigation_bar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "<!-- Bottom Navigation Shell -->", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_compact_footer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "<!-- Compact Footer -->", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_screen", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_whatsapp_fab", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "<!-- WhatsApp Floating Action Button -->", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_search_section", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_filter_bottom_sheet", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/stitch/html/home-catalogo-mobile.html", "source_location": "button#openFilterBtn opens #filterDrawer", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_filter_drawer_script", "target": "design_stitch_html_home_catalogo_mobile_filter_bottom_sheet", "relation": "imp